recommend check-in (Keaton) -- three things want his word and none is mine to take. The card is at zero headroom and the ledger at two bytes, so the next lap that books a red cannot write it down until reds_fold.sh's OPEN-row seat is settled. This pier's own tools/e/enclosure.conf still pins two elder paths, and it is gitignored. And Mind's empty 20260828-142844 log reds empty_document for every body until Mind fills it. Mechanically the next Pond lap is orbit two proper: the declarations driven into grants through Caravan's capability pieces, which is a lane brush and wants Dream's nod first.
